{# « Capacités par branche » (issue #843, D3/D11): the waitlist switch,
   then two bordered sub-boxes, each with its own « Enregistrer » — the
   thresholds of the recommendation and the public level, and the capacity
   grid. (The « Décisions automatiques » sub-box comes with IT-09/IT-10.)
   Requires `waitlist_enabled`, `level_thresholds`,
   `level_thresholds_unusable`, `threshold_min_percent`,
   `threshold_max_percent`, `default_capacity` and `capacity_rows`.
   Behaviour (the switch saved on change, the slider kept in step with the
   two fields, the worked example) is public/assets/js/
   registration-capacity-settings.js. #}
{# The slider's geometry, the same as the script's (barLength()): a native
   range input puts value v at half a thumb (1.5rem) plus (v − min) / (max −
   min) of the track left once a thumb is taken off, so each coloured zone
   ends exactly where its handle sits. #}
{% set slider_span = threshold_max_percent - threshold_min_percent %}
{% set slider_yes = ((level_thresholds.yes - threshold_min_percent) / slider_span)|round(5) %}
{% set slider_maybe = ((level_thresholds.maybe - level_thresholds.yes) / slider_span)|round(5) %}
{% set slider_no = ((threshold_max_percent - level_thresholds.maybe) / slider_span)|round(5) %}
{% set slider_full = ((100 - threshold_min_percent) / slider_span)|round(5) %}
{% set width_yes = 'calc(0.75rem + ' ~ slider_yes ~ ' * (100% - 1.5rem))' %}
{% set width_maybe = 'calc(' ~ slider_maybe ~ ' * (100% - 1.5rem))' %}
{% set width_no = 'calc(0.75rem + ' ~ slider_no ~ ' * (100% - 1.5rem))' %}
{% set left_full = 'calc(0.75rem + ' ~ slider_full ~ ' * (100% - 1.5rem))' %}
<section class="card mb-4" id="registration-capacity-box">
    <div class="card-body">
        <h2 class="h5 mb-3">Capacités par branche</h2>

        {# One independent control, so it saves on change (design.md
           §7.13) to POST /config/inscriptions/listes-attente; the script
           greys the thresholds out or back in on the server's answer. #}
        <div class="form-check form-switch mb-3">
            <input class="form-check-input" type="checkbox" role="switch"
                   id="waitlist_enabled" name="waitlist_enabled" value="1"
                   data-waitlist-switch
                   aria-describedby="waitlist_enabled_help"
                   {{ waitlist_enabled ? 'checked' : '' }}>
            <label class="form-check-label" for="waitlist_enabled">Gérer les listes d'attente</label>
            <span class="form-text d-block" id="waitlist_enabled_help">
                Actif : les familles voient pour chaque année de naissance si c'est disponible, limité ou complet,
                et vous voyez une recommandation Oui / Peut-être / Non sur chaque demande. Cette case
                s'enregistre dès que vous la cochez ou la décochez.
            </span>
        </div>

        {# The thresholds stay on the page while waitlists are not
           managed: the fieldset is disabled, so nothing in it can be
           changed or submitted, and the stored values are shown as they
           are. #}
        <form method="post" action="/config/inscriptions/seuils" class="border rounded-3 p-3 mb-3 bg-body-tertiary"
              data-threshold-box>
            {{ csrf_field()|raw }}
            <fieldset class="{{ waitlist_enabled ? '' : 'opacity-50' }}" {{ waitlist_enabled ? '' : 'disabled' }}>
                <legend class="h6 mb-2">Seuils de la recommandation et du niveau public</legend>
                {% if level_thresholds_unusable %}
                    <div class="alert alert-warning small">
                        Les seuils enregistrés ne sont pas utilisables (deux nombres entiers de
                        {{ threshold_min_percent }} à {{ threshold_max_percent }}, « Oui » inférieur à
                        « Peut-être ») : les valeurs ci-dessous, celles par défaut, s'appliquent jusqu'à ce que
                        vous les enregistriez.
                    </div>
                {% endif %}
                <p class="small text-body-secondary mb-2{{ waitlist_enabled ? ' d-none' : '' }}" data-threshold-disabled-note>
                    Désactivés tant que la gestion des listes d'attente est coupée. Les valeurs enregistrées
                    sont conservées.
                </p>

                {# Two range inputs over one bar: the left handle is where
                   « Oui » stops, the right one where « Peut-être » stops,
                   both in percent of the places occupied (1–120). The
                   widths below are what the script keeps in step. #}
                <div class="registration-dual-slider mb-1" data-dual-slider>
                    <div class="registration-dual-slider-bar" aria-hidden="true">
                        <span class="bg-success" data-slider-zone="yes"
                              style="width: {{ width_yes }}"></span>
                        <span class="bg-warning" data-slider-zone="maybe"
                              style="width: {{ width_maybe }}"></span>
                        <span class="bg-danger" data-slider-zone="no"
                              style="width: {{ width_no }}"></span>
                    </div>
                    <span class="registration-dual-slider-full" aria-hidden="true"
                          style="left: {{ left_full }}"></span>
                    <input type="range" class="registration-dual-slider-handle" data-slider-handle="yes"
                           min="{{ threshold_min_percent }}" max="{{ threshold_max_percent }}" step="1"
                           value="{{ level_thresholds.yes }}"
                           aria-label="Oui jusqu'à ce pourcentage de places occupées">
                    <input type="range" class="registration-dual-slider-handle" data-slider-handle="maybe"
                           min="{{ threshold_min_percent }}" max="{{ threshold_max_percent }}" step="1"
                           value="{{ level_thresholds.maybe }}"
                           aria-label="Peut-être jusqu'à ce pourcentage de places occupées">
                </div>
                <div class="d-flex small fw-semibold" aria-hidden="true">
                    <span class="text-success-emphasis text-truncate" data-slider-label="yes"
                          style="width: {{ width_yes }}">Oui</span>
                    <span class="text-warning-emphasis text-truncate" data-slider-label="maybe"
                          style="width: {{ width_maybe }}">Peut-être</span>
                    <span class="text-danger-emphasis text-truncate" data-slider-label="no"
                          style="width: {{ width_no }}">Non</span>
                </div>
                <div class="registration-dual-slider-scale small text-body-secondary" aria-hidden="true">
                    <span>0 %</span>
                    <span class="registration-dual-slider-scale-full"
                          style="left: {{ left_full }}">100 % · toutes les places</span>
                    <span>{{ threshold_max_percent }} %</span>
                </div>
                <p class="form-text mt-1 mb-3">
                    La barre est l'ensemble des places d'une année de parcours : elles se remplissent dans l'ordre de
                    priorité, de gauche à droite. Plus la zone verte est grande, plus on dit « Oui ». Au-delà de
                    100 %, on accepte plus de demandes qu'il n'y a de places.
                </p>

                {# Kept as drafts while typed, and only checked (rounded,
                   bounded) when the field is left or Enter is pressed — an
                   empty or invalid entry gives the last value back. #}
                <div class="row g-3">
                    <div class="col-12 col-md-6">
                        {% include 'partials/form_field.html.twig' with {
                            field_id: 'threshold_yes_percent', field_name: 'threshold_yes_percent',
                            label: "Oui jusqu'à … % de places occupées", type: 'number',
                            value: level_thresholds.yes, min: threshold_min_percent, max: threshold_max_percent,
                            step: 1, inputmode: 'numeric', wrapper_class: '',
                            data: { 'threshold-field': 'yes' },
                        } only %}
                    </div>
                    <div class="col-12 col-md-6">
                        {% include 'partials/form_field.html.twig' with {
                            field_id: 'threshold_maybe_percent', field_name: 'threshold_maybe_percent',
                            label: "Peut-être jusqu'à … % de places occupées", type: 'number',
                            value: level_thresholds.maybe, min: threshold_min_percent, max: threshold_max_percent,
                            step: 1, inputmode: 'numeric', wrapper_class: '',
                            data: { 'threshold-field': 'maybe' },
                        } only %}
                    </div>
                </div>
                <p class="small text-body-secondary mt-2 mb-0{{ level_thresholds.maybe > 100 ? '' : ' d-none' }}" data-threshold-over-full>
                    Au-delà de 100 %, vous acceptez plus de monde que de places en comptant sur les départs non
                    annoncés et sur les inscrits qui ne viendront finalement pas.
                </p>

                {# The worked example is written by the script, from the two
                   fields and this capacity: what each level means in places
                   for one year of a branch. #}
                <div class="border rounded-3 bg-body p-3 mt-3 small">
                    <div class="d-flex flex-wrap align-items-center gap-2 mb-2">
                        <label for="threshold_example_capacity">Exemple avec une capacité de</label>
                        <input type="number" class="form-control form-control-sm w-auto" id="threshold_example_capacity"
                               min="1" max="99" step="1" inputmode="numeric" value="{{ default_capacity }}"
                               data-example-capacity>
                        <span>places</span>
                    </div>
                    <ul class="list-unstyled mb-2" data-threshold-example aria-live="polite"></ul>
                    <p class="text-body-secondary mb-0">
                        Les familles voient la même chose sous les noms « Disponible », « Limitée » et « Complet ».
                    </p>
                </div>

                <button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary mt-3">Enregistrer</button>
            </fieldset>
        </form>

        <form method="post" action="/config/inscriptions" class="border rounded-3 p-3 bg-body-tertiary">
            {{ csrf_field()|raw }}
            <h3 class="h6 mb-1">Capacités</h3>
            <p class="small text-body-secondary mb-2">
                Une case vide veut dire <strong>pas de limite</strong> ; pour fermer une branche aux inscriptions,
                indiquez <strong>0</strong>.
            </p>
            <div class="table-responsive">
                <table class="table align-middle mb-0">
                    <thead>
                        <tr>
                            <th>Branche · année</th>
                            <th>Capacité</th>
                        </tr>
                    </thead>
                    <tbody>
                        {% for row in capacity_rows %}
                            <tr>
                                <td>{{ row.label }}</td>
                                <td>
                                    {# `is null` keeps a 0 VISIBLE: `capacity ?? ''` in one
                                       go would print « 0 » and « pas de limite » the same
                                       way, although they are opposite settings
                                       (schema.sql). #}
                                    <input type="number" inputmode="numeric" min="0" max="9999" step="1"
                                           class="form-control form-control-sm registration-capacity-input"
                                           name="capacity[{{ row.age_branch_id }}][{{ row.year_in_branch }}]"
                                           value="{{ row.capacity is null ? '' : row.capacity }}"
                                           placeholder="sans limite"
                                           aria-label="Capacité — {{ row.label }}">
                                </td>
                            </tr>
                        {% endfor %}
                    </tbody>
                </table>
            </div>
            <button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary mt-3">Enregistrer</button>
        </form>
    </div>
</section>
